OL,3,AUrgent plan needed to end 'corridor
OL,4,Acare' for children, health secretary
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe NHS must take urgent action to stop
OL,8,Fchildren receiving treatment in
OL,9,Fhospital corridors, Health Secretary
OL,10,FYvette Cooper has told the BBC.
OL,12,FCooper said she has asked NHS England
OL,13,Fto draw up urgent plans to eliminate
OL,14,Fwhat is known as "corridor care" for
OL,15,Fchildren as a priority, and to
OL,16,Fintroduce new standards for how
OL,17,Fchildren should be treated at A&E.
OL,19,F"I'm clear that child health needs to
OL,20,Fbe a much greater priority for the
OL,21,FNHS," Cooper told the BBC's Sunday with
OL,22,FLaura Kuenssberg.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
