OL,3,AUrgent plan needed to end 'corridor
OL,4,Acare' for children, health secretary
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt comes after more than a dozen health
OL,8,Fgroups urged the health secretary to
OL,9,Ftake action to end corridor care.
